ull,"idx":null,"text":"我們在閱讀文章時，常會覺得內容有問題：「這不太可能吧！」、「這會不會太誇張了？」如果對文章有所質疑，我們可以善用網路工具去搜尋及解決我們的疑惑。","n":72,"ssz":"............1........1..........1......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以本課為例，作者看完文章後，先提出質疑，接下來上網搜尋證據，並將證據標示於註腳，表示自己所言均有所本，不只是自己個人的意見，以加強說服力。","n":69,"ssz":".................................................................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.底下說明作者的閱讀及解決問題的歷程。最後，請你填答最右欄的是非題，只是要讓你檢查自己的閱讀習慣，沒有正確答案哦。","n":58,"ssz":".........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"論述步驟","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文中的例子","n":6,"ssz":".....1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"反思(請打V)","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找出自己疑惑的問題","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這個故事是真的嗎？","n":9,"ssz":".1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我讀完一篇文章後，是不是就完全相信了？\n□是   □否","n":27,"ssz":"..........1....1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][2]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我讀完一篇文章後，是不是就完全相信了？","n":19,"ssz":"..........1....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][2]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□是   □否","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.提出合理的質疑","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如：\nQ2：人類怎麼可能追得上老虎呢？\nQ4：吸了好幾升的血？是真的嗎？","n":37,"ssz":"..............1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2